  "solution": {
    "brief": "1b. Connections from Eges\r\nAs for vertices, it is not possible to calculate directly orientation of connections\r\nplaced along edges. To define connection plane, the center point of the edge\r\nis used as origin, and the edge itself as Y-axis. X-Axis needs to be defined\r\naccording to desired orientation (in this case, the Z-axis), Connection  can then\r\nbe created with the \"ConnectionFromPlane\" component.",
